# Every text file is normalised to LF in the repository and checked out as LF on
# all platforms. Without this, Windows' core.autocrlf rewrites the working tree to
# CRLF, which made ESLint's linebreak-style rule and the pre-push hook fail locally
# even though CI (which checks out LF) passed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets git must never normalise.
*.png      binary
*.jpg      binary
*.jpeg     binary
*.gif      binary
*.ico      binary
*.icns     binary
*.woff     binary
*.woff2    binary
*.ttf      binary
*.otf      binary
*.dat      binary
*.exe      binary
*.dll      binary
*.msi      binary
*.keystore binary
